  "verseCount": 56,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amupeputsa Yesu ku Nazareti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu anachoka kumeneko napita ku mudzi kwawo, pamodzi ndi ophunzira ake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsiku la Sabata litafika, anayamba kuphunzitsa mʼsunagoge, ndipo ambiri amene anamumva anadabwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MRK 6:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iwo anafunsa kuti, \"Kodi munthu uyu anazitenga kuti zimenezi? Kodi ndi nzeru yotani imene munthu ameneyu wapatsidwa, kuti Iye akuchitanso zodabwitsa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodi uyu si mpalamatabwa uja? Kodi uyu si mwana wa Mariya ndi mʼbale wa Yakobo, Yose, Yudasi ndi Simoni? Kodi alongo ake si ali ndi ife?\" Ndipo anakhumudwa naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu anawawuza kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Mneneri amalemekezedwa kulikonse kupatula kwawo, ndi pakati pa abale ake ndi a mʼbanja mwake.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.6.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.6.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sanachite zodabwitsa kumeneko, koma anangosanjika manja pa odwala ochepa ndi kuwachiritsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Iye anadabwa chifukwa chakusowa chikhulupiriro kwawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1",
        "vid": "MRK 6:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Atuma Ophunzira Khumi ndi Awiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MRK 6:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pamenepo Yesu anayenda mudzi ndi mudzi kuphunzitsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atayitana khumi ndi awiriwo, Iye anawatuma awiriawiri ndipo anawapatsa ulamuliro pa mizimu yoyipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zomwe anawalangiza ndi izi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Musatenge kanthu ka paulendo koma ndodo yokha; osatenga buledi, thumba, kapena ndalama.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.6.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.6.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Muvale nsapato koma osatenga malaya apadera.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Pamene mulowa mʼnyumba mukakhale momwemo kufikira mutachoka mʼmudzimo.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.6.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.6.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Ndipo ngati pa malo ena sakakulandirani kapena kukumverani, sasani fumbi la kumapazi anu pamene mukuchoka, kuti ukhale umboni wowatsutsa.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.6.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.6.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anatuluka kupita kukalalikira kuti anthu atembenuke mtima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anatulutsa ziwanda zambiri ndi kudzoza mafuta odwala ambiri ndi kuwachiritsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yohane Mʼbatizi Adulidwa Mutu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfumu Herode anamva zimenezi, pakuti dzina la Yesu linali litadziwika kwambiri. Ena amati, \"Yohane Mʼbatizi waukitsidwa kwa akufa, ndipo nʼchifukwa chake mphamvu zochita zodabwitsa zinkagwira ntchito mwa Iye.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena anati, \"Iye ndi Eliya.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MRK 6:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enanso anati, \"Ndi mneneri, ofanana ndi mmodzi wa aneneri akale.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma Herode atamva zimenezi anati, \"Yohane, munthu amene ndinamudula mutu, waukitsidwa kuchokera kwa akufa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti Herode iye mwini analamula kuti amumange Yohane ndi kumuyika mʼndende. Anachita izi chifukwa cha Herodia, mkazi wa mʼbale wake Filipo, amene iye anamukwatira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti Yohane ankanena kwa Herode kuti, \"Sikololedwa kwa inu kuti mukwatire mkazi wa mʼbale wanu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Herodia anamusungira Yohane chidani ndipo anafuna kumupha, koma sanathe kutero,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chifukwa Herode anaopa Yohane ndipo anamuteteza, podziwa kuti iye anali munthu wolungama ndi woyera mtima. Herode akamamva Yohane, ankathedwa nzeru; komabe amakonda kumumvetsera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pomaliza mpata unapezeka. Pa tsiku lokumbukira kubadwa kwake, Herode anakonzera phwando akuluakulu ake, akulu a ankhondo ndi anthu odziwika a mu Galileya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana wamkazi wa Herodia atabwera ndi kudzavina, anakondweretsa Herode ndi alendo ake a pa mphwandopo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MRK 6:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mfumu inati kwa mtsikanayo, \"Undipemphe chilichonse chimene ukuchifuna, ndipo ndidzakupatsa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo analonjeza ndi lumbiriro kuti, \"Chilichonse chimene upempha ndidzakupatsa, ngakhale theka la ufumu wanga.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye anatuluka nati kwa amayi ake, \"Kodi ndikapemphe chiyani?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MRK 6:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iye anamuyankha kuti, \"Mutu wa Yohane Mʼbatizi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nthawi yomweyo mtsikana uja anafulumira kupita komwe kunali mfumu ndi pempho lake: \"Ndikufuna kuti mundipatse pomwe pano mutu wa Yohane Mʼbatizi mʼmbale.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfumu inamva chisoni chachikulu, koma chifukwa cha lumbiro lake ndi alendo ake a pa mphwandolo, sanafune kumukaniza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nthawi yomweyo iye anatumiza yemwe anali ndi ulamuliro wonyonga anthu kuti abweretse mutu wa Yohane. Munthuyo anapita, nakadula mutu wa Yohane mʼndende,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabweretsa mutuwo mʼmbale. Anawupereka kwa mtsikanayo, ndipo iye anakapereka kwa amayi ake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atamva izi, ophunzira a Yohane anabwera nadzatenga mtembo ndi kukawuyika mʼmanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Adyetsa Anthu 5,000",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atumwi anasonkhana mozungulira Yesu namufotokozera zonse zomwe anachita ndi kuphunzitsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Popeza kuti panali anthu ambiri amene amabwera ndi kumapita, analibe mpata wakuti adye, ndipo Iye anawawuza kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Tiyeni kuno kumalo achete kuti tikapume.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.6.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.6.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo anachoka okha pa bwato napita kumalo a okhaokha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma ambiri amene anawaona akuchoka anawazindikira ndipo anathamanga wapansi kuchokera mʼmidzi yonse nakayambirira kufika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu atafika ku mtunda ndi kuona gulu lalikulu la anthu, anamva nawo chisoni chifukwa anali ngati nkhosa zopanda mʼbusa. Ndipo anayamba kuwaphunzitsa zinthu zambiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nthawi iyi nʼkuti dzuwa litapendeka, ndipo ophunzira ake anabwera kwa Iye nati, \"Kuno ndi kuthengo, ndipo ano ndi madzulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awuzeni anthuwa azipita ku midzi ndi madera ozungulira, kuti akadzigulire kanthu kakuti adye.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma Iye anayankha kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Apatseni kanthu koti adye.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.6.37",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.6.37"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MRK 6:37"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iwo anati kwa Iye, \"Apa pafunika ndalama za miyezi isanu ndi itatu zomwe munthu amalandira! Kodi tipite kukagwiritsa ntchito ndalama zotere kugulira buledi kuti tiwapatse adye?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye anawafunsa kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Muli ndi malofu a buledi angati? Pitani mukaone.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.6.38",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.6.38"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MRK 6:38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ataona anati kwa Iye, \"Asanu ndi nsomba ziwiri.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pamenepo Yesu anawalamulira kuti awakhazike anthu pansi mʼmagulu pa msipu obiriwira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo anakhala pansi mʼmagulu a anthu 100 ndi gulu la anthu makumi asanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atatenga malofu a buledi asanu ndi nsomba ziwiri, nayangʼana kumwamba, Iye anayamika nagawa malofu a bulediwo. Kenaka anawapatsa ophunzira ake kuti awapatse anthu. Ndipo anagawanso nsomba ziwirizo kwa onse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onse anadya ndipo anakhuta,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndipo ophunzira ake anatola buledi ndi nsomba zotsalira zokwanira madengu khumi ndi awiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiwerengero cha amuna amene anadya chinali 5,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Ayenda pa Nyanja",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nthawi yomweyo Yesu anawuza ophunzira ake kuti alowe mʼbwato ndi kuti atsogole kupita ku Betisaida, pamene Iye ankawuza anthu kuti azipita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atawasiya, Iye anakwera ku phiri kukapemphera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pofika madzulo, bwato linali pakati pa nyanja, ndipo Iye anali yekha pa mtunda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye anaona ophunzira ake akuvutika popalasa bwato, chifukwa mphepo imawomba mokumana nawo. Pa nthawi ya mʼbandakucha Iye anafika kwa iwo akuyenda pa nyanja. Anali pafupi kuwapitirira,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "koma atamuona Iye akuyenda pa nyanja, anaganiza kuti anali mzukwa. Iwo anafuwula,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pakuti onse anamuona ndipo anachita mantha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MRK 6:50"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nthawi yomweyo Iye anawayankhula nati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Limbani mtima! Ndine. Musachite mantha.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "MRK.6.50",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "MRK.6.50"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Iye anakwera mʼbwato pamodzi nawo, ndipo mphepo inaleka. Iwo anadabwa kwambiri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "popeza sanazindikire zimene zinachitika pa malofu a buledi; pakuti mitima yawo inali yowuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
